  "decisions": [
    "Typed pre-admission TurnStartCapacity preserves positive NotSubmitted before registration during exact Core terminalization.",
    "Goal and Queue idle deferral uses the existing bounded Core scheduler, exact generation, weak wake ownership and loaded-thread Arc identity.",
    "Goal verifies generation after queue ordering; Queue verifies the same loaded Arc inside its dispatch guard. Current cleanup ownership and all current safety guards remain.",
    "Three new Goal regression tests cover cleanup deferral deduplication/capacity, completed replacement generation and loaded Arc replacement. Existing Queue test now sends64 duplicate idle notifications while preserving all original assertions.",
    "Held-gate tests capture the real Started turn ID before releasing the gate, then assert public TurnComplete after release. A legitimate replacement test calls public ThreadStore shutdown before reopening; production delivery and live-writer guards remain unchanged.",
    "New Goal dev dependency core_test_support has its single Cargo.lock edge. Canonical Bazel module update/check completed; MODULE.bazel.lock has no byte change."
  ]
